WHAT YOU MAY DO

Download this mod and use it, on any server, for free. That includes a server you run
yourself, and a server other people play on.

Make videos, streams, and screenshots of it, and say what you like about it.

WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

Sell it, or anything that contains it. That covers paid access, paid downloads, paid
servers whose selling point is this mod, ad-gated links, and the Minecraft Marketplace.
The fan content itself is never for sale.

Redistribute a modified copy. Fork it for yourself; do not pass a changed copy off as this
one.

Take the name, the art, or the writing and use them in a different project.

NOTES

No official art, no text from any book, and no series name is included in this mod. The
place names are used as fan reference. The writing, the archetypes, the models, and the
code in this repository are original to this project.

Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang Synergies AB. This project is not affiliated with
Mojang or Microsoft.
